  "body": " Sets of integers       The set of all integers Why is is used for the set of integers? Part of the reason is because already stands for many other things in mathematics and physics. But why ? In the past, a lot of European mathematics was written in German and the German word for numbers is Zahlen which starts with the letter . The name for the set of all integers was introduced by the German mathematician David Hilbert who is rightfully famous for many other reasons. Source: Integer. (2024, May 20). (See Wikipedia . ) is .    The set of all positive integers is .    The set of all natural numbers (or set of all non-negative integers ) is .      "
