  "title": "Sets of integers.",
  "body": " Sets of integers       Which of the sets , , and have the integer 0 as an element?  The integer 0 is an element of and , but it is not an element of .      Which of the sets , , and are subsets of the others?  Every positive integer is a natural number so is a subset of . Every positive integer and every natural number is an integer so and are subsets of . And, of course, each set is a subset of itself too.        "
